{"id":"13683e2e5294f4b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Embedding Critical Point","display":"df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point — ZFC Model10 Embedding Critical Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point","58-df-zfc-model7-critical-point"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point — ZFC Model10 Embedding Critical Point","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point</span><span>58-df-zfc-model7-critical-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-embedding-critical-point — ZFC Model10 Embedding Critical Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (transitive set-coded structures) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:M\\to N\">\\(j:M\\to N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in M\">\\(\\kappa\\in M\\)</span> (ordinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> (source predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure-universe operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\)</span> (elementary-embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\)</span> (merged alias)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The critical point is the least ordinal moved by the specified elementary embedding; transitivity and membership are imposed on the universes of the set-coded structures, not on their tuple codes.</li>\n<li>The model7 name is an exact alias of the same four-place predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)$ (elementary-embedding predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"j:M\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\land\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7CriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel10EmbeddingCriticalPoint}_S(\\kappa,j,M,N)","display":true}],"bytes":1976,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-27